{"boundary":"Current graph impact and prior corrections are inputs to examine, not independent approval.","kind":"SOURCE_AUDIT_SUBJECT","source_record_sha256":"791910f282c4f082490e2a3bc217eed839c1b07ed522ffa8debd532614bf8ace","source_ref":"src:research:mao-liping:2013:natal-family","trace":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h06:natal-family-ties","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"INFERENCE","statement":"基于南部县档案的研究表明，清代部分出嫁女婚后仍与娘家保持往来，危机时娘家可能提供资源或干预。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"SECONDARY","source":"src:research:mao-liping:2013:natal-family"}]},{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h06:aid-is-limited","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"INFERENCE","statement":"同一研究同时显示姻亲互助受家庭资源限制，不能推出娘家固定、持续、足额供养的普遍规则。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"SECONDARY","source":"src:research:mao-liping:2013:natal-family"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"毛立平，《清代下层妇女与娘家的关系——以南部县档案为中心的研究》，《近代中国妇女史研究》第21期，2013年6月","url":"https://www.mh.sinica.edu.tw/MHDocument/PublicationDetail/PublicationDetail_1533.pdf"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:ab0ec619b8b0ce0169a5e92d379950a93779e3d5db78878afc2f56989c3b381c","sha256":"ab0ec619b8b0ce0169a5e92d379950a93779e3d5db78878afc2f56989c3b381c"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:6a296fa7157747efa8d4f61dba01279d23daea28d7dd284bc4c5a5993f007826","sha256":"6a296fa7157747efa8d4f61dba01279d23daea28d7dd284bc4c5a5993f007826"},"excerpt_revision":{"previous_source_sha256":"8eb1777f9f6b6e09e035846c38f03da8e798c668faccc01faed5398084b336d5","ref":"asset:sha256:1923a3a5bb6f34cc8f36c97c5c51bd6cbfdea734e58ba7d49fec18e682b3df12","sha256":"1923a3a5bb6f34cc8f36c97c5c51bd6cbfdea734e58ba7d49fec18e682b3df12"},"id":"src:research:mao-liping:2013:natal-family","legacy_locator":{"pages":"6-7","topic":"出嫁女与娘家往来及互助局限"},"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:92f625f02a9597f94a54b8d13d06c26702e1b795d6713f926f77ff27e3ba1716","joiner":"","kind":"PDF_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"d416305d83f99e69362cf4f931a61696d05b2000860c3b56f987dafb932ef10c","raw_text_sha256":"535ae5e87d6f6003eca0f094ec111a7b09bf440b4fc210a2df223d9d9b1dfc63","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":669,"start":554,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:7"}]},"locator_verification":{"reason":"Revised raw excerpt verified; correction and claim impact are recorded separately.","report_ref":"asset:sha256:d403946e42e9da0f4925b505663d4009785902d3f849ae0256cdb8adec623f96","report_sha256":"d403946e42e9da0f4925b505663d4009785902d3f849ae0256cdb8adec623f96","source_record_sha256":"791910f282c4f082490e2a3bc217eed839c1b07ed522ffa8debd532614bf8ace","status":"VERIFIED"},"notes":"二手研究且样本主要为四川下层妇女、年代多集中嘉道以后；只能软支持“娘家联系/有限援助渠道”，不能外推固定供养义务。","text":"親情使得娘家與出嫁女仍保持密切往\n來，稍有餘力的娘家會對生活貧困的女兒女婿予以接濟；反\n之，若娘家貧困，女兒亦千方百計進行救助－以女性為紐\n帶的姻親關係同樣是下層家庭的主要社會關係。另一方面，\n下層社會姻親之間的彼此救助頗具局限性","text_sha256":"535ae5e87d6f6003eca0f094ec111a7b09bf440b4fc210a2df223d9d9b1dfc63","title":"毛立平《清代下层妇女与娘家的关系——以南部县档案为中心的研究》","type":"SECONDARY_RESEARCH","witness":{"annotation":"基于124件清代四川南部县衙门妇女案件","label":"毛立平论文","siglum":"MAO-2013-NANBU"}},"title_axes":[],"type":"source"}}
